OL,3,AMan jailed for throwing bottle at
OL,4,Amigrant protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe pleaded not guilty to a separate
OL,7,Fcharge of assaulting a police officer,
OL,8,Frelating to an incident on 11
OL,9,FSeptember, and will face trial at
OL,10,FPortsmouth Magistrates Court at a later
OL,11,Fdate.
